(text_box "NPN Darlington emitter follower - the op-amp drives the base, the emitter follows.  Shunt in the output return, second LM358 half lifts it into ADC range." (at 308 138 0) (size 88 14) (margins 0.9 0.9 0.9 0.9) (stroke (width 0) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "48c19c3e-9bca-4daa-b1d8-48a891bcd092"))
(text_box "No switcher IC - the MCU drives all four gates.  BUCK: leg A chops, Q4 parked on.  BOOST: Q1 parked on, leg B chops.  Dead-time and bootstrap refresh in firmware." (at 252 154 0) (size 96 16) (margins 0.9 0.9 0.9 0.9) (stroke (width 0) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "1814f81a-a828-4368-9f65-f482563eb6bb"))
(text_box "CH224K requests 5 / 9 / 12 / 15 / 20 V through CFG1..3.  The MCU re-reads ADC_VBUS 500 ms after plug-in: no rise means a legacy 5 V port." (at 16 102 0) (size 88 14) (margins 0.9 0.9 0.9 0.9) (stroke (width 0) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f112857-5496-4a18-a1c6-52cc366de20e"))
